            <title>[IGNITE-16759] Fix .NET tests of dotnet services for Windows platform.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16759</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-15650&quot; title=&quot;Statistics for platform services.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-15650&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-15650&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; caused .NET test failure on Windows platform. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reason: wrong runtime binding. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Solution: simplified method calls. Dynamic and ordinary service object are now separated.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
